"BGM: 東方妖恋談","duration":3.5,"slideTitle":"第22スライド","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","telop":"せっかく来た私は一人取り残された。","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 22","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceCharacter":"操夢","id":"21C29A01-55C6-47BF-A46A-E60F147F9879"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.023.jpeg","voiceDuration":6.534331065759638,"animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_023_操夢.wav","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","duration":8.6,"slideTitle":"第23スライド","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","telop":"学校の授業が始まるにはまだ大分日数があるので鎌倉におってもよし、帰ってもよいという境遇にいた私は、当分元の宿に留まる覚悟をした。","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 23","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceCharacter":"操夢","id":"97D5B5FF-2376-4AE1-96E0-0B516E5B8311"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/こころ上_1__89da902c03\/こころ上_1__89da902c03.024.jpeg","voiceDuration":7.6191156462585035,"animationName":"なし","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_024_操夢.wav","bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","duration":9,"slideTitle":"第24スライド","characterName":"操夢","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","transitionName":"なし","telop":"友達は中国のある資産家の息子で金に不自由のない男であったけれども、学校が学校なのと年が年なので、生活の程度は私とそう変りもしなかった。","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 24","audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","voiceCharacter":"操夢","id":"611B563F-00E9-4233-A924-644555206F10"},{"slideImagePath":"\/Volu